    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "一个看似专业的名字「ControlNet」，背后藏着怎样一个直观问题？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "文生图扩散模型已经能够生成高质量图像，但创作者难以精确控制几何、姿态与布局。ControlNet 通过给现有预训练模型加入空间条件解决这一缺口，而不必为每种控制类型重新训练独立生成器。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-primary-record", "source-arxiv-paper"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-locked-copy",
                "claim-zero-convolution"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个漂亮的方向。真正让它运转起来的核心机制是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "架构锁定原始扩散编码器，并创建接收边缘、深度、姿态或其他条件的可训练副本。零初始化卷积连接两个分支，使系统从等价于预训练模型的状态出发，逐步学习控制信号。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-primary-record", "source-arxiv-paper"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-locked-copy",
                "claim-zero-convolution"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "那它为什么没有停留在一篇论文或一次实验里？后来研究者真正继承了什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "专家通常把 ControlNet 视为可控扩散的标准接口，因为它在保留强大基础模型的同时加入可复用空间引导。它广泛影响创作工具与后续适配器，使内容生成能够与姿态、深度、边缘、分割或布局控制分离。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-primary-record", "source-arxiv-paper"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-locked-copy",
                "claim-zero-convolution"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "SUMMARY",
            "text": "「ControlNet」留下的关键，不只是一项成果，而是一种后来可以继续检验、改造和扩展的方法。",
